@model Portal.Pages.DuctView
@* A duct between two stations, owned by the stage on its right — a duct is about entering the
   stage it points at (design.md D2).

   Motion is a reading, not decoration: only a duct carrying traffic moves, and the constrained
   tone exists precisely so a full prefix is not drawn as stopped traffic (design.md D5). The whole
   element is decoration to assistive technology — the relationship it draws is carried in the
   accessible tree by the consequence bar instead. *@
<div class="sx-pipe @Model.ToneClass" style="grid-column:@Model.Column" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="sx-duct"></span>
    <span class="sx-chip">@Model.Chip</span>
</div>
